5. Roles & Responsibilities

Performer

* Extract reports from STAR.
* Reconcile reclaim populations.
* Review all applicable statuses.
* Identify aged reclaims.
* Prepare follow-up files.
* Contact relevant stakeholders.
* Track responses and status updates.
* Complete control documentation.

Validator

* Independently review the completed control.
* Verify population completeness.
* Verify ageing assessments.
* Validate stakeholder follow-ups.
* Confirm control completion and sign-off.

